==Northern Sami==

===Etymology===
From Finno-Volgaic ''*yärvä''. Compare also [[Estonian]] ''[[järv]]'', [[Finnish]] ''[[järvi]]'', [[Karelian]] ''[[järvi]]'', [[Latvian]] and [[Lithuanian]] ''[[jūra]]''.

